 to put together much more than this - I leave it up to the Godot maintainers to decide whether they want these changes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675110866/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675129866","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114196#issuecomment-3675129866","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114196","id":3675129866,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bDggK","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T13:39:56Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T13:41:42Z","body":"That crash log should be sufficient, thank you\r\n\r\nYou're not obligated to put in any more work than you are willing, but I'm pointing out the bug fixing and triage process, to ensure work that goes into the engine is doing something useful, especially to ensure it actually fixes some issue someone has rather than the issue actually being elsewhere, it's important not to play \"whack a bug\" with the codebase but to be able to make informed decisions on what to merge (it's especially important to know if something actually fixes anything or if it just masks a bug elsewhere) ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675129866/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675491822","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114196#issuecomment-3675491822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114196","id":3675491822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bE43u","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T15:26:36Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T15:26:49Z","body":"Amended the commit message to follow our [guidelines](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#format-your-commit-messages-with-readability-in-mind).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675491822/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675546185","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114196#issuecomment-3675546185","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114196","id":3675546185,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bFGJJ","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T15:44:09Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T15:44:09Z","body":"I agree, if `take_connection` can fail even if `is_connection_available` is true, then an error check should be added:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/551ce8d47feda9c81c870314745366b24957624b/core/io/socket_server.h#L50-L65\r\nStill, I agree with @AThousandShips that it would be better to get to the root of this problem if possible. I'm curious if you have a scenario with multiple connections to the DAP server. This code was copied back then from LSP at the time, but I can't think of any scenario where multiple connections is useful in DAP, and I'm pretty sure the implementation is not tackling it correctly either, so I'm curious if this the case here.\r\n\r\nIf you want to, and since you can't reproduce this bug locally, we can instead have a chat on [Rocket.chat](https://chat.godotengine.org/home) if you feel this should be analyzed further.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675546185/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675552290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114196#issuecomment-3675552290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114196","id":3675552290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bFHoi","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T15:46:11Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T15:46:11Z","body":"I'd suggest asking the person who reported this to @migueldeicaza to open an issue here on GitHub to look into this if they can, but getting the details would help narrowing it down, but it shouldn't crash in this case but agreed it might be an issue elsewhere that could benefit other areas if fixed","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675552290/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675990453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114196#issuecomment-3675990453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114196","id":3675990453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bGym1","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T17:53:29Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T17:53:29Z","body":"Many of our crashes are only experienced by users in the wild, and we get anonymized crashes from Apple/Google which only contain the crash information, and then we stare at the stack traces and try to prevent another user from hitting the same issue.\r\n\r\nIf I had to estimate, we probably get some 100 crashes like this for every case where a user reaches out to us to complain.   For a mix of reasons, people do not bother, people do not think it will get fixed, people do not know what happened, people fault something else, people do not know how to reach out, people are not familiar with processes.\r\n\r\n50 is probably generous, it could be 100.\r\n\r\nOn our end, we monitor those crashes constantly and while some users might have had a bad experience, it helps future users not run into the same issue.\r\n\r\nI personally think that Godot should distribute an instrumented version of the engine to improve the stability of the engine.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675990453/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676004172","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114196#issuecomment-3676004172","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114196","id":3676004172,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bG19M","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T17:58:43Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T17:58:43Z","body":"> I personally think that Godot should distribute an instrumented version of the engine to improve the stability of the engine.\r\n\r\nIf by instrumented you mean with debug symbols you have https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1342\r\n\r\nIf instead meaning gathering data on crashes etc. that's very complicated and messy with data collection laws etc.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676004172/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676018761","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114196#issuecomment-3676018761","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114196","id":3676018761,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bG5hJ","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T18:04:04Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T18:04:04Z","body":"I mean the latter, when you detect a crash, you upload the data to a site that aggregates it.\r\n\r\nYou could make it an opt-in feature, you ask at startup \"Do you want to assist developers in improving Godot?\" and then if they say yes, you activate the crash reporter, otherwise you do not.\r\n\r\nWe are using Crashlytics from Google, and we also get data from Apple.   But there is a fabulous new stack that I am tempted to use from Bitdrift - which also solves other problems.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676018761/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676023605","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114196#issuecomment-3676023605","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114196","id":3676023605,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bG6s1","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T18:05:54Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T18:08:21Z","body":"I'd suggest opening a proposal, but there's a lot of practical aspects, including how much larger the target audience for Godot is compared with individual projects using Godot, making our handling of the data problematic from a practical perspective (beyond just the legal aspects, and the reasonable aversion of a lot of people to different software collecting data), related concepts and proposals have been discussed in the past and as I recall there was a relatively large push back to the collection of data (then we have the potential issues of forks of the engine pushing telemetry to our data servers causing issues etc.), and we might not get a lot of data for the same reasons of aversion (I wouldn't enable the feature myself for example)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3676023605/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678030122","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114196#issuecomment-3678030122","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114196","id":3678030122,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bOkkq","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-20T18:48:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-20T18:48:26Z","body":"> I mean the latter, when you detect a crash, you upload the data to a site that aggregates it.\r\n\r\nWell we already have a system like this in place ;)\r\nWe have the Editor on the Play Store and this means we do receive ANR and crash reports. While many of these issues are specific to certain Android devices, but addressing them benefits everyone.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678030122/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":nu